its sooo easy :
if you want with only bread boards you can make it using:
  -2xbig breadboards(800pins)
  -6x74hc86
  -6x74hc08
  -4x74hc32
  -400xmale male wires
  (you can use 74LS too)
and with the pcb files its easy too you will need:
  -8xfull adder pcb (or 1 half adder and 7 full adders not recomanded though)
  -1xinput pcb
  -1xoutput pcb
  -1xpower pcb
  -8x74hc86
  -8x74hc08
  -8x74hc32 (7 if you have one half adder and 7 full adders)
  -30x male male wires
